# The widget's QML imports are loaded at run time, so dpkg-shlibdeps cannot
# see them. On Debian 13 the org.kde.plasma.* QML modules core, components
# and extras are in plasma-desktoptheme; plasmoid and configuration come with
# libplasma, which the Plasma shell itself depends on.
# The Pomodoro alarm plays through Qt Multimedia. ${shlibs:Depends} adds
# libqt6multimedia6, which on Debian 13 and Ubuntu 26.04 also ships the
# FFmpeg media plugin and depends on libpulse0, the audio output; there is no
# separate plugin package to name.
# The Pomodoro hourglass is an SVG image; Qt's SVG image plugin draws it.
Depends: plasma-desktoptheme (>= 6.3.0~),
         hicolor-icon-theme,
         qt6-svg-plugins (>= 6.8.0~),
         qml6-module-org-kde-kcmutils (>= 6.13.0~),
         qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami (>= 6.13.0~),
         qml6-module-qtqml (>= 6.8.0~),
         qml6-module-qtquick (>= 6.8.0~),
         qml6-module-qtquick-controls (>= 6.8.0~),
         qml6-module-qtquick-layouts (>= 6.8.0~),
         qml6-module-qtquick-templates (>= 6.8.0~),
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: kwallet6
Description: Tokkl timer widget for the Plasma panel
 A Plasma 6 panel widget for Tokkl, a self-hosted time tracker with a Toggl
 Track compatible API. It signs in to an account on a Tokkl server, shows
 the running timer, starts and stops it, and sets the project and billable
 flag of the next or running entry.
 .
 The token or password is stored in KDE Wallet. Separate amd64 builds target
 Debian 13 and Ubuntu 26.04 with their distribution's Qt and KDE libraries.
